From 70fe1de87d525eeaa518269b4a575d10dab13792 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:33:36 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] kcm_kwintouchscreen: same layout as Screen Edges, hint
 under the preview, scans after the first frame

Page type: Form with a preview (QtWidgets kept, docs/page-design.md 8). kcfg keys (kwinrc TouchEdges/*, effect and script
TouchBorderActivate lists), actions and D-Bus calls are unchanged. Shares src/kcms/screenedges with kcm_kwinscreenedges and
now has the same shape: info line, preview, hint, expanding spacer, same minimum width, same widget names (infoLabel,
monitorHintLabel).

Changed:
- Info line "Swipe from a screen edge towards the center of the screen to run an action." (same verb-first form as the edges page).
- New hint under the preview: "Click an edge of the preview to choose its action."
- Removed the fixed spacer between info line and preview (the edges page has none either).
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_kwintouchscreen.tsv. Markers on the weak rows. Inventory --strict: 19 ok, 0 lost.
- Config-only keys ScreenEdges/TouchTarget and Wayland/DoubleTapWakeup still have no UI; adding one is a feature, left for the
  manager to decide (it would belong in a "Touch" section here).
- Not done: hiding the page when no touch device exists (needs a device check, the shell has no hook for it yet).
HIG ids: HIG-001/005, HIG-019, HIG-057. Page-design 2, 8.

Speed cause (code): the constructor ran monitorInit() (touch.cpp), listing builtin-effect, effect and script packages with
KPackage and creating one KConfigSkeleton per effect/script before the first frame. Now in QTimer::singleShot(0) after the
constructor, followed by load(); save() waits for it. Note: this page lists effects through KPackage "KWin/Script" +
"kwin/builtin-effects/" while the edges page reads the JSON files directly; left as is, both give the same entries as before.
After-numbers: pending, manager will measure. Not built yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
